@startuml
actor User
participant "Flutter App" as App
participant "Route API" as API
participant "Routing Adapter" as Routing
participant "Routing Engine" as Engine
participant "Discovery Service" as Discovery
database "PostGIS" as DB
participant "Ranking Engine" as Rank

User -> App: origin + destination
App -> API: POST /routes/discover
API -> Routing: calculateRoute()
Routing -> Engine: routing request
Engine --> Routing: route geometry
Routing --> API: normalized route
API -> Discovery: discover(route, filters)
Discovery -> DB: spatial query
DB --> Discovery: POI candidates
Discovery -> Rank: score candidates
Rank --> Discovery: ranked POIs
Discovery --> API: result
API --> App: route + POIs
@enduml
